cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cortex as a design, implementation, or negative-results reference, please cite this software."
title: "Cortex: an experimental cognition framework and evaluation record"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tan"
    given-names: "Renyi"
version: "0.33.0"
date-released: 2026-08-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/renyitan/cortex"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Cortex is a completed experimental investigation of structured cognition and durable memory for
  long-running agents. It includes an operator-owned Markdown reference implementation, local
  retrieval and write-integrity mechanisms, a model-backed evaluation harness, and negative results
  showing that the tested package did not establish better delayed-task accuracy than direct use of
  the same evidence.
keywords:
  - "agent memory"
  - "context management"
  - "cognition framework"
  - "negative results"
  - "LLM evaluation"
  - "GitHub Copilot CLI"
